# Empty goal — this action triggers the full pick-and-place cycle run by
# brain.py: a grasp sequence (grasp.py's grasp_trigger action) followed by a
# release sequence (release.py's release_trigger action).
---
bool success
string message
---
# Published on every state-machine transition of brain.py's own cycle
# (act_home_enter/act_grasp/act_release/act_home_exit/idle), and forwarded on
# every state-machine transition reported by whichever sub-sequence is
# currently running as feedback on its own action (grasp_trigger's or
# release_trigger's TriggerGrasp/TriggerRelease.Feedback.state). Combined
# into a single field:
#   "<brain_state>"               while no sub-sequence is active
#   "<brain_state>:<sub_state>"   while act_grasp/act_release is forwarding
string state
